@ycsin The recent merge of https://github.com/zephyrproject-rtos/zephyr/pull/43861 could also give a valid temp 
Could you check again ?
With the following nucleo_wb55rg.overlay  in the /samples/sensor/stm32_temp_sensor/ 
```
/ {
	stm-temp {
		label = "DIE_TEMP";
		compatible = "st,stm32-temp";
		io-channels = <&adc1 17>;
		avgslope = <43>;
		v25 = <1430>;
		ntc;
		status = "okay";
	};
}; 
```

The temperature is measured : 
```
Current temperature: 182.9 �°C                                                  
Current temperature: 182.7 �°C                                                  
Current temperature: 182.9 �°C                                                  
Current temperature: 182.9 �°C  
```

based on the zephyr 1d3dbd49e14e9dec14a6bfa4d69fa56b62406784
and refering to the [stm32g0 datasheet](https://www.st.com/resource/en/datasheet/stm32g071rb.pdf), the Temperature sensor calibration values are defining a **"st,stm32-temp-cal"** node (instead of a simple "st,stm32-temp")
I just add the following `board/nucleo_g071rb.overlay` to the samples/sensor/stm32_temp_sensor/
```
/ {
	stm-temp {
		compatible = "st,stm32-temp-cal";
		io-channels = <&adc1 12>;
		status = "okay";
		ts-cal1-addr = <0x1FFF75A8>;
		ts-cal2-addr = <0x1FFF75CA>;
		ts-cal1-temp = <30>;
		ts-cal2-temp = <130>;
		ts-cal-vrefanalog = <3000>;
		ts-cal-offset = <30>;
	};
};

&adc1 {
    status = "okay";
    has-temp-channel;
};
```

to get 
```
*** Booting Zephyr OS build zephyr-v3.0.0-1625-g1d3dbd49e14e  ***
STM32 Die temperature sensor test
Current temperature: 29.9 �°C
```

same result for nucleo_stm32wb55rg  on ADC1 channel 17

@FRASTM I'm using the correct binding in my branch https://github.com/ycsin/zephyr/commit/1d58b73296f435234047f28263d010f43cc2f7a3 following the merge of https://github.com/zephyrproject-rtos/zephyr/pull/41295

I'd say the `stm32_temp` is working, but with a catch. It needs #44052 to work properly when more than one channel of the ADC is used, i.e.:

![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/1563974/159690156-8e0f8a68-2ae3-4617-a311-1e63122b5e71.png)
